{"id":"word:hebrew:H4159","type":"word","title":"מוֹפֵת","subtitle":"H4159 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a miracle ; by implication, a token or omen","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מוֹפֵת (H4159) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 36 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מוֹפֵת (môwphêth) means a miracle ; by implication, a token or omen First listed occurrence: 1Chr 16 12."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מוֹפֵת","transliteration":"môwphêth","pronunciation":"mo-faith'","strong":"H4159","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4159","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["מוֹפְתַ֖/י","לְ/מוֹפֵ֔ת","מֹפְתָ֖י/ו","מוֹפֵת֙","הַ/מּוֹפֵ֔ת"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",5],["HC/Ncmpa",5],["HC/R/Ncmpa",4],["HC/Td/Ncmpa",3],["HR/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",2],["HTd/Ncmsa",2],["HC/Ncmsa",2],["HTd/Ncmpa",2],["HNcmpc/Sp1cs",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"a miracle ; by implication, a token or omen","usage":"miracle, sign, wonder(-ed at).","full":"H4159. mopheth מוֺפֵת noun masculine Deut 29:2 wonder, sign, portent (= מאֹפֵת ) — מוֺפֵת Exod 7:9 14 t.; מוֺפֶתְכֶם Ezek 12:11 ; מוֺפְתִים Deut 4:34 4 t.; מֹפְתִים 6:22 9 t.; מוֺפְתַי Exod 7:3 ; 11:9 ; מוֺפְתָיו Psa 78:43 ; מֹפְתָיו 1Chr 16:12 ; Psa 105:5 — 1 wonder , as special display of God's power Exod 7:3 ; 11:9 ; Psa 105:5 ; 1Chr 16:12 ; Joel 3:3 ; by Moses and Aaron Exod 4:21 ; 11:10 ; compare 7:9 (in mouth of Pharaoh), by false prophets Deut 13:2 ; 13:3 (|| אות ); usually || אות 4:34 ; 6:22 ; 7:19 ; 26:8 ; 29:2 ; 34:11 ; Psa 78:43 ; 105:27 ; 135:9 ; Jer 32:20-21 , Neh 9:10 ; applied to effect of Yahweh's curse Deut 28:46 (|| אות ); to one protected by ׳י Psa 71:7 . 2 sign or token of future event (compare אוֺת ) 1Kin 13:3 (twice in verse); 13:5 ; 2Chr 32:24 , 31 ; symbolic act Isa 20:3 (|| אות ); as such the term is applied to persons 8:18 (|| אות ) Ezek 12:6 , 11 ; 24:24 , 27 ; compare מ ׳אַנְשֵׁי Zech 3:8 men who serve as a symbol or sign. — Vb. used, of divine act, is נתן Exod 7:9 etc., שׂים Jer 32:20 ; שׂים also of entrusting to human power Exod 4:21 , compare דִּבֶּר 1Kin 13:3 ; of human agency עשׂה Exod 4:21 ; 11:10 , נתן 1Kin 13:3 , 5 .","rootNote":"or מֹפֵת ; from 3302 in the sense of conspicuousness ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 12","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 12","1Kgs 13 3","1Kgs 13 3","1Kgs 13 5","2Chr 32 24","2Chr 32 31","Deut 4 34","Deut 6 22"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":36,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 12","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֹפְתָ֖י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מוֹפֵת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מּוֹפֵ֔ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 5","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כַּ/מּוֹפֵ֗ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 24","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מוֹפֵ֖ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 31","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מּוֹפֵת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 4 34","book":"Deut","chapter":4,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בְ/מוֹפְתִ֜ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 6 22","book":"Deut","chapter":6,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ֠/מֹפְתִים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 7 19","book":"Deut","chapter":7,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הַ/מֹּֽפְתִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Td/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 13 2","book":"Deut","chapter"